                    "value": "FINANCE\nBudget execution = spend / allocated budget.\nOperating margin = operating profit / revenue; not EBITDA.\nExpected ROI = (expected return - investment) / investment.\nMean record ROI is unweighted and separately labeled.\nAttention budget is associated budget, not savings.\n\nDEMAND & SERVICE\nCompletion = completed / (completed + delayed).\nWAPE = sum absolute record errors / actual demand.\nBias = (forecast - actual demand) / actual demand.\nShortage rate = stockout units / actual demand.\nMean inventory observation is not current on-hand stock.",
